---
---

<section id="demo" style="position:relative;padding:96px 64px;background:transparent;border-top:1px solid var(--rulesoft)">
    <div class="section-mark section-mark-left" style="position:absolute;left:34px;top:120px;writing-mode:vertical-rl;color:var(--t4)">示</div>
    <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto">
      <span style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal)">See it run</span>
      <h2 style="font-weight:700;font-size:42px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:12px;color:var(--t1);max-width:780px">Watch the review happen, claim by claim.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--t2);max-width:680px;margin-top:14px">Give Telotia a document and a body of evidence you trust. It breaks the document into individual claims and shows you, claim by claim, what the evidence supports, and what it does not.</p>

      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:36px;margin-top:44px;align-items:start">
        <div class="glow-wrap" style="position:relative;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface-paper)">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rulesoft);font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--t4)"><span style="color:var(--teal)">Live review</span><span>example corpus</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;padding:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rulesoft)">
            <span style="flex-shrink:0;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--teal);border:1px solid var(--teal2);border-radius:3px;padding:3px 9px">Supported</span>
            <div><p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--t1)">The device packaging identifies the imported model and manufacturer lot.</p><span style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--t4)">IFU-22 / page 4</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;padding:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rulesoft)">
            <span style="flex-shrink:0;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--gold);border:1px solid var(--gold2);border-radius:3px;padding:3px 9px">Partial</span>
            <div><p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--t1)">Cleaning instructions cover high-touch surfaces after each patient use.</p><span style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--t4)">Maintenance manual / section 7.2</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;padding:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rulesoft)">
            <span style="flex-shrink:0;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--t3);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:3px;padding:3px 9px">Unsupported</span>
            <div><p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--t1)">The supplied corpus demonstrates bilingual labelling for all external warnings.</p><span style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;color:var(--t4)">No cited passage</span></div>
          </div>
          <a class="lk" href="workspace.html" style="display:block;padding:14px 18px;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:12px;color:var(--teal)">Open the interactive run ↓</a>
        </div>

        <ol style="list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;padding:0">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:16px"><span style="flex-shrink:0;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:24px;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);line-height:1.1">1</span><div><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;color:var(--t1)">Load the document set</h3><p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--t2);margin-top:5px">Drop in the document; Telotia extracts every atomic claim automatically.</p></div></li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:16px"><span style="flex-shrink:0;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:24px;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);line-height:1.1">2</span><div><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;color:var(--t1)">Search the trusted corpus</h3><p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--t2);margin-top:5px">Each claim is matched only against the evidence you supplied, never the open web.</p></div></li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:16px"><span style="flex-shrink:0;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:24px;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);line-height:1.1">3</span><div><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;color:var(--t1)">Grade and cite</h3><p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--t2);margin-top:5px">Supported, Partial, or No support found. Each linked to the exact source passage.</p></div></li>
          <li style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:18px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--t3)">“No support found” means this corpus is silent on the claim, not that the claim is wrong. Results are a starting point for a human reviewer, not a verdict on the work.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
